    "detailed_description": "Shadow of Pharos is a short first-person horror game.<br><br>The game aims to be a fully immersive experience and has no UI by default. To enable accessibility options and general settings, input the following command using the keyboard arrow keys or the controller D-Pad:<br><strong>left, right, left, right, down, down</strong><br><br>The menu will then be accessible by pressing <strong>ESC</strong> on the keyboard or <strong>Back/Share</strong> on a controller.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Default Controls:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Movement:</strong> WASD on keyboard | Left Analog on controller<br></li><li> <strong>Look Around:</strong> Mouse | Right Analog on controller<br></li><li> <strong>Interact:</strong> E on keyboard | Cross/A on controller<br></li><li> <strong>Flashlight:</strong> F on keyboard | Square/X on controller<br></li><li> <strong>Notes:</strong> Tab on keyboard | Options/Start on controller</li></ul><br><strong>Disclaimer: The game's soundtrack was made specifically for the game, and is safe to play on videos/stream.</strong> It's also available for free on TeamGaivot's YouTube channel. If you enjoyed the game, consider supporting the team by purchasing the soundtrack here on Steam and wishlisting our next game Pharos.",
    "about_the_game": "Shadow of Pharos is a short first-person horror game.<br><br>The game aims to be a fully immersive experience and has no UI by default. To enable accessibility options and general settings, input the following command using the keyboard arrow keys or the controller D-Pad:<br><strong>left, right, left, right, down, down</strong><br><br>The menu will then be accessible by pressing <strong>ESC</strong> on the keyboard or <strong>Back/Share</strong> on a controller.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Default Controls:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Movement:</strong> WASD on keyboard | Left Analog on controller<br></li><li> <strong>Look Around:</strong> Mouse | Right Analog on controller<br></li><li> <strong>Interact:</strong> E on keyboard | Cross/A on controller<br></li><li> <strong>Flashlight:</strong> F on keyboard | Square/X on controller<br></li><li> <strong>Notes:</strong> Tab on keyboard | Options/Start on controller</li></ul><br><strong>Disclaimer: The game's soundtrack was made specifically for the game, and is safe to play on videos/stream.</strong> It's also available for free on TeamGaivot's YouTube channel. If you enjoyed the game, consider supporting the team by purchasing the soundtrack here on Steam and wishlisting our next game Pharos.",
